    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the boots of a wild west sheriff and blast your way through a cursed frontier!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Canyon of Outlaws</i> is a thrilling arcade shooter set in a pixelated Wild West world gone mad. As the town\u2019s last line of defense, you must face off against sinister undertakers, walking cacti, and other supernatural horrors threatening your peaceful frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with grit, guns, and a badge, you\u2019ll fight through waves of enemies in fast-paced shootouts across vibrant, handcrafted levels. Every stage brings new enemies, new challenges, and new ways to prove your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your aim and your reflexes \u2014 only the sharpest sheriff can survive this outlaw canyon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-style arcade shooter</strong> with modern action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art visuals</strong> bursting with western charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of enemies</strong> including undead ghouls, killer cacti, and monstrous bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic levels</strong> full of intense firefights and quick decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive western soundtrack</strong> that brings the Wild West to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing bounties, clearing towns, or facing off against towering bosses, <strong>Canyon of Outlaws</strong> delivers a rootin\u2019-tootin\u2019 ride through a haunted western frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your revolver, lock and load \u2014 it\u2019s time to clean up this canyon!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the boots of a wild west sheriff and blast your way through a cursed frontier!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Canyon of Outlaws</i> is a thrilling arcade shooter set in a pixelated Wild West world gone mad. As the town\u2019s last line of defense, you must face off against sinister undertakers, walking cacti, and other supernatural horrors threatening your peaceful frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with grit, guns, and a badge, you\u2019ll fight through waves of enemies in fast-paced shootouts across vibrant, handcrafted levels. Every stage brings new enemies, new challenges, and new ways to prove your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your aim and your reflexes \u2014 only the sharpest sheriff can survive this outlaw canyon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-style arcade shooter</strong> with modern action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel art visuals</strong> bursting with western charm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of enemies</strong> including undead ghouls, killer cacti, and monstrous bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic levels</strong> full of intense firefights and quick decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive western soundtrack</strong> that brings the Wild West to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing bounties, clearing towns, or facing off against towering bosses, <strong>Canyon of Outlaws</strong> delivers a rootin\u2019-tootin\u2019 ride through a haunted western frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your revolver, lock and load \u2014 it\u2019s time to clean up this canyon!</strong></p>",
